Open-source apps bundled with Sukhi Play
========================================

Sukhi Play ships a small number of open-source apps so that a child with no
internet connection still has something to open. They are other people's work,
included under their own licences and unmodified except where noted. Each one
lives under vendor/<name>/, with the upstream licence in vendor/<name>/LICENSE,
the exact commit it was built from in vendor/<name>/UPSTREAM, and any changes
we made recorded in vendor/<name>/patch.mjs.

    vendor/kids-coloring
        Kids Coloring, copyright (c) 2026 oh-namgyu, MIT licence.
        https://github.com/oh-namgyu/kids-coloring
        Changed for this build: English only, the language toggle removed,
        the service worker removed, and asset paths made relative.

Neither the authors of these apps nor their projects are connected to Sukhi
Play or endorse it.
